graph TD
    %% Nodes & Components
    User([User Prompt / Command]) --> Guardrails[Guardrails & Input Validation]
    
    subgraph Agentic Engine
        Guardrails -->|Valid Input| Planner[Agent Planner / Intent Parser]
        Planner --> Reflection{Check Output / Self-Reflect}
        Reflection -->|Validation Failed / Conflict| Planner
    end

    subgraph PawPal System Tools
        Planner -->|Execute Action| ToolRouter[Tool Execution Router]
        ToolRouter --> TaskSorter[Task Sorting & Filter Tool]
        ToolRouter --> RecurrenceEngine[Recurring Task Automation Tool]
        ToolRouter --> ConflictDetector[Conflict Detection Module]
    end

    subgraph Logging & Storage
        ToolRouter --> Logger[(System Logs & Audit Trail)]
        TaskSorter --> Database[(PawPal Task Store)]
        RecurrenceEngine --> Database
        ConflictDetector --> Database
    end

    subgraph Verification & Evaluation
        Reflection -->|Validation Passed| ResponseGen[Response Generator]
        ResponseGen --> UserOutput([Final User Response])
        
        %% Testing Loop
        PytestSuite[Pytest Suite & Reliability Evaluator] -.->|Automated Test Checks| Planner
        PytestSuite -.->|Verify Deterministic Logic| ToolRouter
        HumanCheck([Human Reviewer / Evaluation Loop]) -.->|Audit Logs & Results| Logger
    end

    %% Styling
    classDef main fill:#2b5c8f,stroke:#fff,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef tools fill:#1e7e34,stroke:#fff,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef eval fill:#b05200,stroke:#fff,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    class Guardrails,Planner,Reflection main;
    class ToolRouter,TaskSorter,RecurrenceEngine,ConflictDetector tools;
    class PytestSuite,HumanCheck eval;
